---
import diagram from '../assets/diagrams/nitrotpm-authorisation.svg?url';
---

<figure class="nitrotpm-diagram">
	<div class="frame">
		<starlight-image-zoom-zoomable>
			<img src={diagram} alt="OpenTofu declares trusted PCRs; the runner proves its AWS identity and NitroTPM measurements to the control plane, while KMS releases keys only to valid PCRs." loading="lazy" />
			<button aria-label="Zoom NitroTPM authorization diagram" class="starlight-image-zoom-control">
				<svg aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#starlight-image-zoom-icon-zoom"></use></svg>
			</button>
		</starlight-image-zoom-zoomable>
	</div>
	<figcaption>How AWS identity, a measured boot and the KMS key policy form one authorization decision.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
	.nitrotpm-diagram { margin: 1.5rem 0; }
	.frame {
		background: #fff;
		border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline-light);
		border-radius: var(--spin-radius);
		padding: 1rem;
		overflow-x: auto;
	}
	img { display: block; width: max(100%, 700px); height: auto; }
	figcaption { color: var(--sl-color-gray-3); font-size: var(--sl-text-sm); margin-top: 0.5rem; }
</style>
